## How to re-run

```bash
cd ~/Projects/openOODA/ooda
export OODA_SRC_ROOT="$PWD" OODAC_BIN="$PWD/oodac/oodac" OODA="$PWD/bin/ooda"
source ~/.local/ooda-toolenv/env.sh   # optional wasm/clang
bash scripts/fixed_point.sh
# then Part B.1 rails listed above
```
